# Workstream evidence and session drivers stay local, including source-like files.
# Keep formal indexes, identity/receipt records, Markdown reviews and test inputs.
# Per-run acceptance/review/preview JSON stays local; formal ledgers live outside here.
# Existing tracked evidence remains tracked; raw files are never deleted here.
/docs/framework/workstreams/evidence/**
!/docs/framework/workstreams/evidence/**/
!/docs/framework/workstreams/evidence/**/*.md
!/docs/framework/workstreams/evidence/**/*.patch
!/docs/framework/workstreams/evidence/**/manifest.json
